          JSON-scoped territories.
        </p>
        <p class="chips">
          <span class="chip sm">Laravel</span><span class="chip sm">MySQL</span>
          <span class="chip sm">Vue 3</span><span class="chip sm">Redis</span>
        </p>
        <div class="term">
          <div class="term-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>level02.log</span></div>
          <pre class="code">-- Concept — per-status counts in a single pass over today's orders
SUM(CASE WHEN status = 'pending' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS pending_count</pre>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="level">
        <div class="level-head">
          <span class="lvl-no">03</span>
          <div class="lvl-title">
            <h3>TOTP Shield: self-hosted 2FA service</h3>
            <span class="lvl-tag">WORLD 2025 · SIDE BOSS</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>
          A central two-factor authentication provider that other applications integrate with
          through a REST API. Client apps enrol users via QR code, verify OTPs at login, and
          delegate all TOTP handling to the service. The web dashboard manages API apps,
          monitors usage, and administers users across three roles.
        </p>
        <p class="chips">
